WEBVTT

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:01.254
that predicted weight gain

00:07:01.254 --> 00:07:04.254
also predicted the development of eating disorders.

00:07:04.254 --> 00:07:05.822
The other factor, by the way,

00:07:05.822 --> 00:07:07.251
those of you who are parents,

00:07:07.251 --> 00:07:10.480
was being teased by family members

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.991
about their weight.

00:07:11.991 --> 00:07:13.827
So don't do that.

00:07:13.827 --> 00:07:15.565
(Laughter)

00:07:15.565 --> 00:07:18.201
I left almost all my graphs at home,

00:07:18.201 --> 00:07:20.494
but I couldn't resist throwing in just this one,

00:07:20.494 --> 00:07:22.907
because I'm a geek, and that's how I roll.

00:07:22.907 --> 00:07:25.386
(Laughter)

00:07:25.386 --> 00:07:27.734
This is a study that looked at the risk of death

00:07:27.734 --> 00:07:29.600
over a 14-year period

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:32.102
based on four healthy habits: